## Conventions

- This index points to where truth lives. Do NOT duplicate content here.
- Update entries with current dates as files change.
- If a file isn't in this index, ask: should it be? Not everything has to be — the index is curated, not exhaustive.
- Vault search via tools like pyqmd is the second line of defense; the index is the first.
